  <Id>k__BackingField: duckboards
  <Title>k__BackingField: Duckboards
  <Icon>k__BackingField: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 57028ae5f99e34e33940494c3048b90c, type: 3}
  <Description>k__BackingField: Narrow wooden planks, called pitkospuut, lead across
    a wide bog. They protect the bog and keep your feet dry.
  <Weight>k__BackingField: 2
  <MaxOccurrences>k__BackingField: -1
  <Trigger>k__BackingField: 0
  <Choices>k__BackingField:
  - <Text>k__BackingField: Walk carefully on the boards
    <RequiredItem>k__BackingField: {fileID: 0}
    <Outcome>k__BackingField:
      <Text>k__BackingField: Step by step you cross the bog. A crane calls in the
        distance.
      <Effects>k__BackingField:
      - rid: 6632890833693573242
    <Risk>k__BackingField:
      <Chance>k__BackingField: 0.2
      <ReducedBy>k__BackingField: []
      <Outcome>k__BackingField:
        <Text>k__BackingField: A wet plank is slippery and you fall into the bog.
        <Effects>k__BackingField:
        - rid: 6632890833693573243
  - <Text>k__BackingField: Walk next to the boards
    <RequiredItem>k__BackingField: {fileID: 0}
    <Outcome>k__BackingField:
      <Text>k__BackingField: No risk of slipping, but every step crushes the bog
        moss.
      <Effects>k__BackingField:
      - rid: 6632890833693573244
    <Risk>k__BackingField:
      <Chance>k__BackingField: 0
      <ReducedBy>k__BackingField: []
      <Outcome>k__BackingField:
        <Text>k__BackingField: 
        <Effects>k__BackingField: []
